time, normalize on load. Treat offset-less values as the source's actual timezone, and convert everything to UTC before charting.\n\nI haven't changed the file. Once you know the real timezone of the offset-less rows, I can write the normalization step.", "commits": [], "branch": "main", "before": {}, "after": {}}}